  "notes": "Image 2 is the same pinout artwork with a title ('Compatible With The Pinout Of ESP32-DevKitC Development Board'); transcribed separately per rule 11. Board silkscreen (VP, 34, G, D2, CLK...) listed first in functions. Printed as shown: GPIO3 carries 'UOTXD' (same as GPIO1, read as U0TXD per O/0 context rule), GPIO23 'VSPI_MOST', GPIO13 'HSPI_MISO'. The diagram marks GPIO36/39/34/35 with an input-only arrow, most GPIOs with a PWM symbol, and GPIO9/10/11/8/7/6 with '!' (shared with flash memory, can't be used as regular GPIO per the key); symbols omitted from functions."
